# Task 167-001 Execution Plan: T1 — Code Inventory + Dead Code + Unused Features Audit

## Goal
READ-ONLY self-audit. Produce `.audit/sprint-167/T1-code-inventory.md` (≥500 lines, ≥6 sections) + `.audit/sprint-167/T1-predicate.sh` (GO/NO_GO bash check).

## Approach
1. **Sub-task 1.1 — CLI/MCP Inventory**: List all `src/cli/commands/*.ts` files and `src/mcp/tools/*.ts` files; map each to a one-line description; flag undocumented entries.
2. **Sub-task 1.2 — Dead Code & Unreferenced Exports**: Use grep to find exports in `src/` and check usage references. Also identify dead/orphan files.
3. **Sub-task 1.3 — Sprint 138-166 Feature Adoption**: Cross-reference the BIG feature list from IDENTITY.md against `src/` to verify each feature has a runtime wire path. Categorize 41 vitest skips by directory/reason. Identify Bug N regression test gap.

